OL,3,GNEWSAIs there support for a referendum
OL,4,Aon asylum seekers?
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK says it wants to give people
OL,7,Fa say on plans to house asylum seekers
OL,8,Fat an RAF base in Suffolk by holding a
OL,9,Freferendum. Opposition politicians have
OL,10,Fcalled the move a publicity stunt while
OL,11,Faccusing Reform of attempting to hijack
OL,12,Fnext year's local elections. What do
OL,13,Fsome people living in the county town,
OL,14,Fwho could be taking part in this vote,
OL,15,Factually think of the idea and do they
OL,16,Fwant their voice heard?
OL,18,FThe proposed referendum is due to be
OL,19,Fdiscussed at a Suffolk County Council
OL,20,Ffull council meeting on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
