OL,3,GNEWSAIs there support for a referendum
OL,4,Aon asylum seekers?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRAF Barnham near Thetford could be
OL,7,Fconverted into accommodation for 1,250
OL,8,Fmale asylum seekers for a minimum of 10
OL,9,Fyears under government plans.
OL,11,FSpeaking in Ipswich, Julie Smith said
OL,12,FReform should not be asking people's
OL,13,Fopinion as part of a referendum.
